    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d658">

                <pb facs="0715" n="603" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg603"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/1225: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-05T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 5,
                                1919, 1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your December 2, 1 p.m. You may inform Japanese Foreign Office that substance of
                    Department’s November 12, 5 p.m., was telegraphed for communication to the
                    British, French and Italian Governments on November 22.<anchor n="57"
                        xml:id="d658-f1"/> You were requested to communicate it to Peking for
                    communication to Chinese Government on November 19, 2 p.m.<anchor n="57"
                        xml:id="d658-f2"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
